              "q": "How early should I place an order?",
              "a": "For standard cakes, please order at least 24 hours in advance. Custom designs may need 2–3 days."
            },
            {
              "q": "Can I request a custom cake design?",
              "a": "Yes. Share your reference image, flavour preference and serving size through WhatsApp."
            },
            {
              "q": "Do you offer same-day delivery?",
              "a": "Selected flavours and sizes may be available for same-day delivery depending on the order time and delivery area."
            },
            {
              "q": "How can I order?",
              "a": "Tap Order Now or Chat on WhatsApp and share your preferred cake, size and delivery date."
            }
          ]
        },
